B.GA=s(["I have worked this pier for twenty years and I have never seen a crab that angry.","Feed the machine, love. The machine is hungry.","If we survive this I am asking for a raise. A small one. A biscuit.","Three of the same? Squash 'em. That is what my mother did.","Do not look the Inspector in the eye. He feeds on eye contact.","I put a penny in for you. Do not tell the manager.","They keep going round. Like my ex-husband.","That one is wearing a tiny hat. Shoot the hat."],t.s)
B.Sp=new A.ju("Welcome to Grimley Pier","Last night of the season, and things are climbing out of the sea. They walk the boardwalk round and round. If 100 are on the pier at once, it's over.","next")
B.Sn=new A.ju("Feed the machine","Tap SUMMON. Every penny in the Oracle-O-Matic gives you a random figurine, and they fight for you. Summon three.","summon")
B.So=new A.ju("Three of a kind","Same figurines stack, three to a cell. Tap a full stack and press MERGE to squash them into one random figurine from the next tier up. Merging is how you get strong.","next")
B.Sr=new A.ju("Move them about","Drag a figurine onto another cell to swap them. Cells next to the boardwalk see the most action, so put your best ones there.","next")
B.Sq=new A.ju("Luck and grease","Tea leaves come every fifth wave and from bosses. Spend them on a gamble for rare figurines. ELBOW GREASE makes a whole tier hit harder. MYTHICS shows the recipes for the four legends of the pier.","next")
B.Ss=new A.ju("Bosses","Every 10th wave a boss turns up, and you have 60 seconds to get rid of it. Wave 40 is the Landlord. Good luck, love.","next")
